[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11640.469, "timestamp": "03:14:00", "text": "我看了他们的东西，我很喜欢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11644.07, "timestamp": "03:14:04", "text": "它。所以我就说，对，是韩语。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11647.79, "timestamp": "03:14:07", "text": "现在。所以，呃，应该是韩语的那个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11652.03, "timestamp": "03:14:12", "text": "下面应该写着“是”。 9美元"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11654.79, "timestamp": "03:14:14", "text": "某物。但是，是的，还有额外的部分。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11657.67, "timestamp": "03:14:17", "text": "此外，他们还建议这可能……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11660.469, "timestamp": "03:14:20", "text": "情况有所好转"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11664.87, "timestamp": "03:14:24", "text": "但这仍然像是即使是对于……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11667.03, "timestamp": "03:14:27", "text": "按英国标准来说，这很贵。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11669.91, "timestamp": "03:14:29", "text": "理解？就是它就是它就是它就是我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11671.75, "timestamp": "03:14:31", "text": "就像你用印度语说的那样，我就能理解了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11675.19, "timestamp": "03:14:35", "text": "印度货币很贵。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11679.19, "timestamp": "03:14:39", "text": "在印度，但就像你知道的，在英国"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11682.87, "timestamp": "03:14:42", "text": "货币标准依然很高。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11684.67, "timestamp": "03:14:44", "text": "就是它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11687.19, "timestamp": "03:14:47", "text": "如果这是为了爱好，那它就是爱好吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11689.91, "timestamp": "03:14:49", "text": "合理的话，可以，如果你能做到的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11693.19, "timestamp": "03:14:53", "text": "理由充分。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11695.91, "timestamp": "03:14:55", "text": "不是每个人都能看待某些事物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11698.63, "timestamp": "03:14:58", "text": "以类似的方式，所以我理解这一点。"}]